---
// Author / About section
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <div class="author-avatar" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="/images/author-photo.jpg"
        alt="Author photo"
        width="200"
        height="200"
        loading="lazy"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'; this.nextElementSibling.style.display='flex';"
      />
      <div class="avatar-placeholder">✍️</div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-text">
      <p class="section-label">Meet the Author</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">A Story Born From Love</h2>
      <p class="section-body">
        The Show Papi series was created to capture a feeling every parent
        knows — that heart-bursting pride when your child runs up and says
        <em>"Watch me, I can do it!"</em>
      </p>
      <p class="section-body">
        Written for the little ones who want to show off what they've learned,
        and for the parents cheering them on every step of the way, each book
        in the series is a love letter to family, curiosity, and the magic of
        those first milestones.
      </p>
      <div class="author-social">
        <a
          href="https://www.instagram.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="social-link"
          aria-label="Instagram"
        >
          📸 Instagram
        </a>
        <a
          href="mailto:papi@showpapi.com"
          class="social-link"
          aria-label="Email"
        >
          ✉️ Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .about-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .author-avatar {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .author-avatar img {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--color-sunshine), var(--shadow);
  }

  .avatar-placeholder {
    display: none;
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-sunshine), var(--color-coral));
    font-size: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--color-sunshine), var(--shadow);
  }

  .about-text .section-body {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .author-social {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .social-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    border: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
  }

  .social-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-coral);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .author-avatar {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .author-social {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
